%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject:
    fileID: 0
  m_PrefabInstance:
    fileID: 0
  m_PrefabAsset:
    fileID: 0
  m_GameObject:
    fileID: 0
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script:
    fileID: 11500000
    guid: bd46540139c34d48bd88012dfc1a4510
    type: 3
  m_Name: KernelOnboardingTexts
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: ''
  tableId: kernel-onboarding-texts
  entries:
  - key: onboarding.speaker
    language: ko
    text: 현장지원과
  - key: onboarding.speaker
    language: en
    text: Field Support
  - key: onboarding.office
    language: ko
    text: 사무국
  - key: onboarding.office
    language: en
    text: Secretariat
  - key: profile.regularVisitor.name
    language: ko
    text: 한정우
  - key: profile.regularVisitor.name
    language: en
    text: Han Jeong-woo
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.options
    language: ko
    text: 대답>
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.options
    language: en
    text: Answer>
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.none
    language: ko
    text: 지금 답할 질문이 없습니다.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.none
    language: en
    text: There is no question to answer right now.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.invalid
    language: ko
    text: 표시된 선택지 중 하나를 입력하세요.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.invalid
    language: en
    text: Enter one of the displayed options.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.sent
    language: ko
    text: 응답을 전송했습니다.
  - key: terminal.dialogue.answer.sent
    language: en
    text: Answer sent.
  - key: onboarding.welcome
    language: ko
    text: Kernel을 찾으셨군요.
  - key: onboarding.welcome
    language: en
    text: You found Kernel.
  - key: onboarding.connection
    language: ko
    text: 현장지원과입니다. 연결을 확인했습니다. 작전망의 기본 사용법부터 안내하겠습니다.
  - key: onboarding.connection
    language: en
    text: Field Support here. The line is open. Let's go through the basics of the operations network.
  - key: onboarding.listen
    language: ko
    text: "입력창이 비어 있을 때 Enter를 누르면 다음 안내로 넘어갑니다. 다음 명령을 실행해 보십시오.\n{command}"
  - key: onboarding.listen
    language: en
    text: Press Enter with an empty input to continue the briefing. Try entering {command}.
  - key: onboarding.permissions
    language: ko
    text: 잘하셨습니다. 권한 목록은 현재 사용할 수 있는 정보와 행동을 보여줍니다.
  - key: onboarding.permissions
    language: en
    text: Good. The permissions list shows the information and actions currently available to you.
  - key: onboarding.reference
    language: ko
    text: "{slot} = 까지 입력한 뒤 색으로 표시된 [[hq|지휘소]]를 눌러 넣으십시오. Enter로 보내면 {slot}으로 그 대상을 부를 수 있습니다."
  - key: onboarding.reference
    language: en
    text: "Type {slot} =, then click [[hq|headquarters]] to insert it. Press Enter to register {slot} as its name."
  - key: onboarding.substitution
    language: ko
    text: 이제 지휘소를 가리키는 이름은 {slot}입니다.
  - key: onboarding.substitution
    language: en
    text: Now you can use {slot} to refer to headquarters.
  - key: onboarding.dot
    language: ko
    text: 대상 뒤에 마침표를 입력하면 권한 목록이 나옵니다. Tab이나 Enter로 후보를 확정하십시오. 후보 이름을 쓰기 시작하면 Space로도 확정할 수 있습니다. 다음 Enter로 명령을 보냅니다.
  - key: onboarding.dot
    language: en
    text: Type a dot after a target to see its permissions. Accept a suggestion with Tab or Enter. Space also accepts after you start typing its name. Press Enter again to send the command.
  - key: onboarding.invoke
    language: ko
    text: '연결 상태를 확인하겠습니다. 다음 명령을 입력하십시오:

      {command}'
  - key: onboarding.invoke
    language: en
    text: Let's check the connection. Enter {command}.
  - key: onboarding.release
    language: ko
    text: '통신 확인. 마지막으로 다음 명령으로 연습용 치환문을 폐기하겠습니다:

      {command}'
  - key: onboarding.release
    language: en
    text: Connection confirmed. Finally, discard the exercise substitution by entering {command}.
  - key: onboarding.oath
    language: ko
    text: 귀하는 Kernel로서 성실히 임무를 수행하고 심각한 정보 누출에 대한 차단 활동에 적극적으로 임할 것임을 맹세할 수 있습니까? 이 결정은 귀하의 Kernel 직무 수행에 있어 가장 중요한 동의이며, 실제 서류상 동의 행위와 동일한 법적 효력을 가집니다.
  - key: onboarding.oath
    language: en
    text: Do you swear to carry out your duties faithfully as Kernel and to take an active role in containing serious information leaks? This is the most important consent you give as Kernel and has the same legal effect as signed written consent.
  - key: onboarding.oath.accepted
    language: ko
    text: 맹세를 접수했습니다. 동의가 작전 기록에 남았습니다.
  - key: onboarding.oath.accepted
    language: en
    text: Your oath has been received. Your consent is on record.
  - key: onboarding.oath.declined
    language: ko
    text: 동의하지 않으신 것으로 기록했습니다. 안내를 계속하겠습니다.
  - key: onboarding.oath.declined
    language: en
    text: Your refusal is on record. The briefing will continue.
  - key: onboarding.world
    language: ko
    text: 치환문을 폐기해도 실제 지휘소는 사라지지 않습니다. 대상을 부르는 규칙만 정리한 것입니다.
  - key: onboarding.world
    language: en
    text: Discarding a substitution does not remove headquarters. You have only removed a rule for referring to it.
  - key: onboarding.coffee
    language: ko
    text: "[[hq|지휘소]]를 눌러 넣고 마침표를 입력하면 권한 목록에서 커피 요청도 찾을 수 있습니다."
  - key: onboarding.coffee
    language: en
    text: "Click [[hq|headquarters]] and type a dot to find the coffee request in its permissions."
  - key: onboarding.finish
    language: ko
    text: 곧 아홉 시 예약 손님이 들어옵니다. 말풍선을 눌러 적당히 맞장구만 치시면 됩니다. 상담을 마치고 잠시 쉬시면 첫 임무를 메일로 보내겠습니다.
  - key: onboarding.finish
    language: en
    text: Your nine o'clock client is about to arrive. Click the speech bubble to chime in now and then. Take a short break after the session and we will send your first assignment by mail.
  - key: onboarding.detour1
    language: ko
    text: '그 명령도 유효합니다만, 지금은 다음 명령을 확인하는 중입니다:

      {command}

      계속해 볼까요?'
  - key: onboarding.detour1
    language: en
    text: That command is valid, but we're checking {command} right now. Shall we continue?
  - key: onboarding.detour2
    language: ko
    text: 호기심은 좋습니다. 순서만 지켜 주십시오. 지금 요청한 명령은 {command}입니다.
  - key: onboarding.detour2
    language: en
    text: Curiosity is useful. Please follow the sequence. The requested command is {command}.
  - key: onboarding.angry1
    language: ko
    text: 'Kernel. 지금은 장난칠 때가 아닙니다.

      {command}

      지시를 이행하십시오.'
  - key: onboarding.angry1
    language: en
    text: 'Kernel. This is not the time for games.

      {command}

      Follow the instruction.'
  - key: onboarding.angry2
    language: ko
    text: '같은 설명을 반복하게 하지 마십시오.

      {command}

      듣고 계십니까, Kernel?'
  - key: onboarding.angry2
    language: en
    text: 'Do not make me repeat myself.

      {command}

      Are you listening, Kernel?'
